# statue-any-side: the healing statue in Roland Forest (map 34, object 0x37D at 308,468) from the front, both
# sides, the back and a corner. Needs state room (Jian's room: statue_warp_states on our ROM with --save,
# statue_find_maps on the vanilla ROM). Warps in at entrance 102 and walks up to the statue's clearing; then for
# each side puts Jian about 28 px off the statue, walks into it, sets HP 5 and MP 1, presses A, reads HP/MP.
load room
wait 5
pin u16 0x020B77EC 34
pin u16 0x020B77F2 102
pin u8 0x020B77EE 0
press Right 40
press Down,Right 40
press Right 40
press Down 80
wait 200
unpin
wait 30
press Up 100
wait 10
save m34
peek u32 0x020B466C max_hp
peek u32 0x020B4674 max_mp
load m34
wait 5
poke u32 0x020B6CB4 0x134000
poke u32 0x020B6CB8 0x1ee000
wait 10
press Up 16
wait 10
poke u32 0x020B4668 5
poke u32 0x020B4670 1
dump 0x020B6CB4 0x14 front_south_pos
shot front_south_a
press A 4
wait 150
peek u32 0x020B4668 front_south_hp
peek u32 0x020B4670 front_south_mp
shot front_south_b
load m34
wait 5
poke u32 0x020B6CB4 0x114000
poke u32 0x020B6CB8 0x1d4000
wait 10
press Right 16
wait 10
poke u32 0x020B4668 5
poke u32 0x020B4670 1
dump 0x020B6CB4 0x14 side_west_pos
shot side_west_a
press A 4
wait 150
peek u32 0x020B4668 side_west_hp
peek u32 0x020B4670 side_west_mp
shot side_west_b
load m34
wait 5
poke u32 0x020B6CB4 0x154000
poke u32 0x020B6CB8 0x1d4000
wait 10
press Left 16
wait 10
poke u32 0x020B4668 5
poke u32 0x020B4670 1
dump 0x020B6CB4 0x14 side_east_pos
shot side_east_a
press A 4
wait 150
peek u32 0x020B4668 side_east_hp
peek u32 0x020B4670 side_east_mp
shot side_east_b
load m34
wait 5
poke u32 0x020B6CB4 0x134000
poke u32 0x020B6CB8 0x1b8000
wait 10
press Down 16
wait 10
poke u32 0x020B4668 5
poke u32 0x020B4670 1
dump 0x020B6CB4 0x14 back_north_pos
shot back_north_a
press A 4
wait 150
peek u32 0x020B4668 back_north_hp
peek u32 0x020B4670 back_north_mp
shot back_north_b
load m34
wait 5
poke u32 0x020B6CB4 0x11e000
poke u32 0x020B6CB8 0x1ea000
wait 10
press Up,Right 16
wait 10
poke u32 0x020B4668 5
poke u32 0x020B4670 1
dump 0x020B6CB4 0x14 corner_southwest_pos
shot corner_southwest_a
press A 4
wait 150
peek u32 0x020B4668 corner_southwest_hp
peek u32 0x020B4670 corner_southwest_mp
shot corner_southwest_b
